This is a notice that poppr version 2.2.1 has been released on CRAN and is available for download. It's mainly a maintenance release with some minor bug fixes and new features including adding layout options to imsn().

You can see the list of changes here: https://github.com/grunwaldlab/poppr/releases/tag/v.2.2.1

Download it from CRAN:

install.packages('poppr', repos = 'https://cran.rstudio.com')

Best,
Zhian

